# Keep kumo clouds visible

Never delete, hide, or disable `.section-kumo` / the kumo cloud wallpaper on Homework Hub (or any site page that uses it).

- Do **not** remove the markup, CSS, or classes that render the decorative clouds.
- Focus mode and other chrome/UI changes must keep the clouds visible.
- The user loves them — treat them as permanent brand atmosphere, not optional decoration.
